OL,3,GNEWSACould Paul Mescal's GAA shorts    
OL,4,Acraze be making its way to the Dior    
OL,5,Acatwalk?                               
OL,7,FA casting call for sportsmen in Dublin 
OL,8,Fhas sparked speculation that Northern  
OL,9,FIrish designer Jonathan Anderson could 
OL,10,Fbe bringing an unexpected influence to 
OL,11,Fhis first Dior show in Ireland.        
OL,13,FThe rumours began after Dublin         
OL,14,Fmodelling agency Not Another Intl      
OL,15,Fadvertised for sports stars -          
OL,16,Fparticularly Gaelic Athletic           
OL,17,FAssociation (GAA) players - to take    
OL,18,Fpart in a show on 4 December.          
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
