OL,3,GNEWSACould Paul Mescal's GAA shorts    
OL,4,Acraze be making its way to the Dior    
OL,5,Acatwalk?                               
OL,7,FThe date is significant as it coincides
OL,8,Fwith Dior's presentation of its 2027   
OL,9,Fautumn/winter collection at Trinity    
OL,10,FCollege Dublin.                        
OL,12,FAlthough the identity of the agency's  
OL,13,Fclient has not been revealed, fashion  
OL,14,Ffans have been quick to speculate that 
OL,15,FAnderson, Dior's creative director,    
OL,16,Fcould be keen to bring a distinctly    
OL,17,FIrish touch to the catwalk.            
